notes.body:
@martin.r.mathieson I have also checked your change with my own pcap-generator for eCPRI and it seems to work as expected:

![image](/uploads/9a630f6552239b92d4d43a7cd73b343c/image.png){width=702 height=738}

Also, thank you for changing the "eCPRI Payload" to be a tree without any nest level, I really like it! For me the change is good to be merged.

